+**`complete(id, token, result)`** commits the job and returns a receipt `{ id, outcome, token, result, completedAt, completionSeq }`. `outcome` is `committed` the first time and `already-committed` for a repeat with the same token (after a restart or compaction too), which returns the stored result and writes nothing. Any other token throws `StaleLeaseError`; a pruned job throws `UnknownJobError`. A lease past its deadline can still commit until a reaper, reclaim or cancel acts on it.
